<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch VIB details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Dutch VIB details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch prpoerty fund VIB said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 16 held.</p>
<p>In March, VIB announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 3.45 guilders. Payment date will be May 5, VIB said. The payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>VIB shares closed at 51.80 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
